      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04077_yakedo_ex4",
      "japanese": "{料理|りょうり}をしていて{油|あぶら}がはねて、{手|て}に{火傷|やけど}をした。",
      "english": "Oil splattered while I was cooking and I got a burn on my hand.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04077_yakedo_ex5",
      "japanese": "{火傷|やけど}の{跡|あと}がなかなか{消|き}えなくて、{夏|なつ}でも{長袖|ながそで}を{着|き}ている。",
      "english": "The burn scar won't go away, so I wear long sleeves even in summer.",
